  "short_description": "<p>Handwoven rattan basket made in Vietnam – strong, stylish, and eco-friendly. Ideal for home storage, hotels, and wholesale orders.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"706\">This <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"449\">high-quality woven rattan basket</strong> is handcrafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam, using natural rattan sourced sustainably from rural regions. Strong, flexible, and beautifully finished, the basket is ideal for home storage, retail display, hotel décor, or as part of a curated gift package.</p>\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"959\">Each basket showcases the artistry of Vietnamese weaving tradition, with a clean natural look and tight, durable weave. Designed to last, it’s perfect for organizing household items, towels, toys, magazines, or adding rustic charm to modern interiors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1164\">At <strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"995\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we provide <strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1030\">OEM/ODM production</strong>, size and color customization, eco-packaging, and large-volume export for wholesale customers across Europe, the U.S., and worldwide.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1193\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1193\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1565\">\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1246\">\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1246\">100% handwoven from sustainably harvested rattan</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1289\">Durable, lightweight, and eco-friendly</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1336\">\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1336\">Natural or custom color finishes available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<p data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1407\">Multi-purpose: storage, display, gift packaging, hotel accessories</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1450\">\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1450\">Available in multiple sizes and shapes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1500\">\n<p data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1500\">Custom labeling, branding &amp; packaging options</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1565\">\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1565\">Produced by skilled artisans in certified Vietnamese workshops</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1570\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1599\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1597\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1753\">This product is not just a storage solution — it&#8217;s a symbol of Vietnam’s <strong data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1694\">cultural heritage</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1726\">economic sustainability</strong>. Our woven rattan baskets:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"2064\">\n<li data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1840\">\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1840\"><strong data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1786\">Support rural communities</strong>, providing income for farmers in off-season periods</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1927\"><strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1891\">Use nearly 100% domestic materials and labor</strong>, keeping value inside the country</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1995\">\n<p data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1995\"><strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1961\">Promote eco-friendly living</strong>, replacing plastic alternatives</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2064\">\n<p data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2064\"><strong data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2041\">Help preserve traditional craftsmanship</strong> for future generations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2229\">As a <strong data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2121\">factory, supplier, and manufacturer in Vietnam</strong>, we’re proud to export quality handmade goods that serve global markets while benefiting local livelihoods.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2234\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2270\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2268\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2442\">Looking for a reliable <strong data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2347\">rattan basket manufacturer or supplier in Vietnam</strong>?<br data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2351\" />📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2384\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2387\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2442\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2618\">",
